y collection time gives indeterminate, because the kidney context is optional in the group and its absence must never read as normal.","It reads the recorded collection times only; no evaluation time is used.","No window and no edge rule are supplied: both parameters are disabled, so the window output reads parameter-not-enabled until a named local clinician enables them.","Nothing reads as complete: the count has no expected number. A missing kidney context gives indeterminate, not a low count."],"statement":"Describes when samples were recorded as collected. It says nothing about any value, about the quality or timeliness of care, or about a trend, and it is not decision support."},"manifest":{"id":"diabetes-ckd.sample-gap","name":"Diabetes and CKD: sample collection gap","publisher":{"name":"Synthetic test publisher"},"references":[{"id":"diabetes.glycaemia-documentation","type":"contextual-element","version":"0.1.0"},{"id":"ckd.kidney-function-documentation","type":"contextual-element","version":"0.1.0"}],"standard":{"version":"0.1.0"},"status":"draft","type":"analytics-package","version":"0.1.2"},"operatorSet":{"name":"ccis-core-ops","version":"0.1.0"},"outputs":[{"carries":["warnings","limitations","missingDataNotes"],"id":"sampleGap","kind":"value","states":["needs-data","indeterminate"],"unit":"min","valueType":"time"},{"carries":["warnings","limitations","missingDataNotes"],"id":"sampleOrder","kind":"classification","labels":["hba1c-first","creatinine-first","same-time"],"states":["needs-data","indeterminate"]},{"carries":["warnings","limitations","missingDataNotes"],"id":"sampleWithinWindow","kind":"classification","labels":["within-window","outside-window"],"states":["needs-data","indeterminate","parameter-not-enabled"]},{"carries":["warnings","limitations","missingDataNotes"],"id":"documentedFactCount","kind":"value","states":["needs-data","indeterminate"],"unit":"1","valueType":"integer"}],"parameters":[{"allowedRange":{"max":525600,"min":0},"enabledByDefault":false,"id":"sampleWindow","kind":"duration","label":"Window between the two sample collection times","note":"The allowed range is a technical bound of the format. It is not a clinical value and not a suggestion.","suppliedBy":"Local clinician (role, not yet named)","units":["min","h"]},{"allowedChoices":["inside","outside"],"enabledByDefault":false,"id":"edgeRule","kind":"choice","label":"Edge rule for boundaries","suppliedBy":"Local clinician (role, not yet named)"}],"population":"People recorded as having diabetes, chronic kidney disease, or both. Narrowing is for the local clinician to declare.","provenance":{"basis":"None. No clinical source and no clinical review.","origin":"Synthetic demonstration written for the second demo (rows 4.5d, 4.5d.1 and 4.5d.1a)."},"question":"For this case, how far apart were the HbA1c sample and the creatinine sample recorded as collected, and which came first?"}